{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261016/photo/bkn-20261016125453931-1016_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261016130241\"/><p>涉案被捕女子。</p><p>元朗區執法人員昨日(15日)於區內展開執法行動，打擊非法使用電動可移動工具。行動中，拘捕一名女子，涉嫌「無牌駕駛」、「駕駛時沒有第三者保險」及「駕駛未獲發牌照的車輛」等罪名。</p><p>執法人員重申，非法駕駛電動可移動工具不僅觸犯法例，更對其他道路使用者及行人構成極大安全威脅。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T05:19:49.005446+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T04:54:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T05:17:36.983370+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T05:17:36.983370+00:00","content_hash":"8934ebcb9b4f35945736ea161966148fa5d503bd153318a824a401f862d33ee8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}